tooltip_text = "Mandelbrot set
Iterate z(n+1) = z(n)^2 + c from z(0) = 0.
Points that remain bounded belong to the set.

Max Iter: raises the iteration cap. Higher values reveal
finer boundaries but cost performance.
Colors: changes the strength and frequency of exterior bands."
